      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "BOOSEapplication.AppEnd",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/BOOSEapplication.AppEnd.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Represents the terminating command for structured control blocks\nsuch as IF, WHILE, FOR, and METHOD within the BOOSE scripting system.</p>\n<p>\n<xref href=\"BOOSEapplication.AppEnd\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> is responsible for resolving block termination\nand determining whether execution should continue normally or jump\nback to the start of a loop construct.\n</p>\n<p>\nThe behaviour of this command depends on the <xref href=\"BOOSEapplication.AppEnd.Type\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> value\nassigned during <xref href=\"BOOSEapplication.AppEnd.Set(BOOSE.StoredProgram%2cSystem.String)\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>:\n<ul><li><code>if</code> → no action; control simply exits the IF block.</li><li><code>while</code> → jumps back to the matching WHILE if the loop condition was true.</li><li><code>for</code> → jumps back to the matching FOR if the loop condition was true.</li><li><code>method</code> → no-op under the direct-call execution model.</li></ul>\n\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
