      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "BOOSEapplication.AppEvaluation",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/BOOSEapplication.AppEvaluation.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Represents a basic evaluation node within the BOOSE execution model.</p>\n<p>\n<xref href=\"BOOSEapplication.AppEvaluation\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> provides a minimal concrete implementation of\n<xref href=\"BOOSE.Evaluation\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> and <xref href=\"BOOSE.IEvaluation\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>, suitable for use\nas a variable or placeholder evaluation object within a stored program.\n</p>\n"
    },
