      "Title": "BOOSEapplication.AppFor",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/BOOSEapplication.AppFor.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Implements the FOR loop construct for the BOOSE scripting system.</p>\n<p>\nAppFor handles loop initialization, iteration, condition checking,\nand early termination by jumping to the matching END FOR when the\nloop condition becomes false.\n</p>\n"
    },
