      "Title": "BOOSEapplication.AppIf",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/BOOSEapplication.AppIf.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Implements the IF conditional command for the BOOSE scripting system.</p>\n<p>\nAppIf evaluates a comparison expression and conditionally executes or\nskips the associated IF block. When the condition is false, control\nflow jumps to the matching ELSE or END IF command.\n</p>\n"
    },
