      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "BOOSEapplication.AppParser",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/BOOSEapplication.AppParser.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Parses script lines into executable BOOSE <xref href=\"BOOSE.ICommand\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> objects.</p>\n<p>\nThe <xref href=\"BOOSEapplication.AppParser\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> is responsible for:\n<ul><li>Normalizing whitespace and removing invisible characters</li><li>Detecting control-flow constructs (IF, WHILE, FOR, METHOD)</li><li>Creating commands via an <xref href=\"BOOSE.ICommandFactory\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref></li><li>Assigning parameters and expressions to commands</li><li>Updating method definitions inside <xref href=\"BOOSEapplication.AppStoredProgram\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref></li></ul>\n\n"
    },
